    <meta name="description" content="Explore the paintings of featured artist Paul Murphy.">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin="">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://vermillionaurora.com/exhibitions/paul-murphy/"><style is:inline>.paul-introduction{max-width:760px;margin:24px auto 32px;line-height:1.65}.paul-introduction p{margin:0 0 14px}</style><link rel="stylesheet" href="/exhibitions/viewer.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/site-header.css">
<meta name="catalog-version" content={catalogVersion} /></head>
  <body><div class="page-shell">      <SiteHeader />

<main class="container exhibition-page">
 <nav class="product-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/exhibitions/">Exhibitions</a><span>/ Paul Murphy</span></nav>
 <p class="eyebrow dark">Featured artist</p><h1>Paul Murphy</h1>
 <img class="exhibition-hero" src="https://media.vermillionaurora.com/images/Ex-Featured-Artist-Paul-Murphy/IMG_7496.jpeg" alt="My tipi, on Grand Traverse Bay by Paul Murphy" fetchpriority="high">
 <div class="paul-introduction"><p>Paul Murphy is my dad. We’ve been painting together since COVID, when he picked up a brush shortly after I did and began painting for the first time in his life. As he leaves the corporate world, he’s discovered a new passion for artistic expression.</p><p>At least once a week, we talk about painting techniques and share images to paint. During COVID, he painted every day for a long stretch, sending me each painting with a poem he had written to accompany it. Those paintings and poems became his book <em>COVID 2020</em>.</p><p>He has published several books of poetry and found readers for his work. <em>COVID 2020</em> and <em>Reflections on Time</em> are available on Amazon. You can also <a href="/products/reflections-on-time/">explore Reflections on Time here</a>.</p></div>
<div class="section-heading"><h2>Paintings by Paul Murphy</h2><p>39 paintings. Select a painting to view details.</p></div>
 <div class="exhibition-grid paul-gallery">{collections.paul.map(entry=><ProductCard product={byId[entry.product]} variant={entry.variant} />)}
</div>
 <nav class="exhibition-nav" aria-label="More exhibitions"><a href="/exhibitions/cape-town/">Adopting Bitcoin Cape Town, South Africa</a><a href="/exhibitions/el-salvador/">Adopting Bitcoin El Salvador</a><a href="/exhibitions/living-room/">My Living Room, Seattle, Washington</a><a href="/exhibitions/studio-601/">Studio 601, Seattle, Washington</a><a href="/exhibitions/victrola/">Victrola Coffee Shop, Seattle, Washington</a><a href="/exhibitions/paul-murphy/" aria-current="page">Paul Murphy</a></nav></main>      <SiteFooter />
    </div>


